  "description": "A Codex CLI 0.160.1 file change (live recording): item.started and item.completed of one stream-local item. The stream names no tool, only the item family, so tool_name is absent and tool_family is file_change; the kind is 2 edit by the family table, not by a guessed underlying tool. item.started is an execution observation (activity 4), not the model's request or its arguments; the changed paths and kinds stay in the retained record; completed is the reported outcome (the processor reports a declined patch as failed).",
